{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261127/photo/bkn-20261127094244322-1127_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261127103939\"/><p>救援人員趕往現場處理傷者。(張開裕攝)</p><p>青衣發生撞船意外。今日(27日)早上9時25分，一艘上環往蛇口客輪在青衣路青衣油庫對開海面撞船塢設施。船上至少24人受傷，其中4人較為嚴重，傷者全部清醒，救援人員趕往現場處理事件，多名傷者分別由救護車送院治理，人員正調查肇事原因。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T03:03:52.839002+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":143,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T01:42:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T02:57:29.760903+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T02:57:29.760903+00:00","content_hash":"22631ccf88ec40df28458a4ee37427fe80a4171dec9b0064ba8c9eedc226b91e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}